    <constraint source="project">The engine fix (skipped-node outputs, PB-02) and the AgentService prompt-from-Action change come with tests that fail on the old code. The playbook engine has no dry run: prove with unit and e2e tests first, then one live call of the Insights card for one matter, recorded. Own worktree off origin/master, own PR, do not merge. BFF hygiene per root CLAUDE.md section 10. Never use --no-verify or bare git stash. You cannot write .claude/. Never save a system playbook in the Designer. No parking.</constraint>
